// was added to prevent: measured at deletion, `gunbc_ci_fleet_timer_install_invoke` had no
// consumer but the `DeclarationRef` inside its own `Scaffold` row, and
// `fleet_timer_self_install` appears in neither surviving workflow.
//
// Its registered `Scaffold` and unbound `DissolutionCondition` go with it. Both described a
// concat-built foreign-executor shell awaiting bash-emit; deleting the emitter discharges
// the obligation instead of carrying it, and an unbound condition whose subject no longer
// exists can never report itself fired.

